#: ../../11-observability.md:5 a553fc7e83524f7a9aaa012550b8a989
msgid ""
"What operators look at first: `fs_cli -x status`, `$log_dir/freeswitch.log`,"
" then Sofia/channel listings. This tree has **no** `mod_prometheus` and no "
"in-repo Grafana/Prometheus dashboards. Counters live in `fs_cli` / ESL "
"events; optional SNMP is compiled off by default."
msgstr ""
"运维人员首先看：`fs_cli -x status`、`$log_dir/freeswitch.log`，然后是 Sofia/channel "
"列表。本代码树 **没有** `mod_prometheus`，仓库内也没有 Grafana/Prometheus 仪表盘。计数器在 `fs_cli` "
"/ ESL 事件里；可选 SNMP 默认未编译进去。"

#: ../../11-observability.md:7 3386f14538cf453f9d62ec2459377aac
msgid ""
"Upstream operator docs: [FreeSWITCH Users "
"Manual](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/) (Part 11 "
"Troubleshooting). Historical wiki: [FreeSWITCH "
"Explained](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-"
"Explained/)."
msgstr ""
"上游运维文档：[FreeSWITCH 用户手册](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/)（第 11 "
"部分排障）。历史 wiki：[FreeSWITCH "
"Explained](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-"
"Explained/)。"

