#: ../../11-observability.md:65 843945896a1b494eb44b2196dd70b23a
msgid ""
"Vanilla `logfile.conf.xml` leaves `<param name=\"logfile\" "
"value=\"/var/log/freeswitch.log\"/>` **commented**; the computed `log_dir` "
"path is what actually opens."
msgstr ""
"Vanilla `logfile.conf.xml` 把 `<param name=\"logfile\" "
"value=\"/var/log/freeswitch.log\"/>` **注释掉了**；真正打开的是计算得到的 `log_dir` 路径。"

#: ../../11-observability.md:67 cbe1506901c54f68b2715e9f16a634a4
msgid ""
"Rotation: `rollover` 1048576000 bytes, `maximum-rotate` 32, `rotate-on-hup` "
"true. Debian unit `ExecReload=/usr/bin/kill -HUP $MAINPID` "
"(`build/freeswitch.service`); that fires `SWITCH_EVENT_TRAP` `Trapped-"
"Signal=HUP` and `mod_logfile` rotates."
msgstr ""
"轮转：`rollover` 1048576000 字节，`maximum-rotate` 32，`rotate-on-hup` true。Debian "
"unit `ExecReload=/usr/bin/kill -HUP "
"$MAINPID`（`build/freeswitch.service`）；这会触发 `SWITCH_EVENT_TRAP` `Trapped-"
"Signal=HUP`，由 `mod_logfile` 轮转。"

#: ../../11-observability.md:69 853cc6c84b414323999a7ffb72d1f1c6
msgid "systemd journal vs the log file"
msgstr "systemd journal 与日志文件"

#: ../../11-observability.md:71 fbcd35c5b9f9445f8019113faf4dc238
msgid ""
"Debian `debian/freeswitch-systemd.freeswitch.service` is `Type=forking` with"
" `-ncwait`. It does **not** set `StandardOutput=journal`. `journalctl -u "
"freeswitch` shows unit start/stop (and any leftover stdout of the forking "
"parent), **not** the full switch log."
msgstr ""
"Debian `debian/freeswitch-systemd.freeswitch.service` 是带 `-ncwait` 的 "
"`Type=forking`。它 **没有** 设置 `StandardOutput=journal`。`journalctl -u "
"freeswitch` 显示 unit 启停（以及 fork 父进程残留的 stdout），**不是** 完整的交换机日志。"

#: ../../11-observability.md:73 a006e68cdbbf44878546f390b6c52dd4
msgid ""
"`mod_syslog` is **compiled** (`build/modules.conf.in`: `loggers/mod_syslog`)"
" but **not loaded** in vanilla (`modules.conf.xml` comments it out). If you "
"load it, `conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/syslog.conf.xml` sends facility "
"`user`, ident `freeswitch`, default level `warning`, with UUIDs. On systemd "
"hosts that often appears in the journal via the syslog socket."
msgstr ""
"`mod_syslog` **已编译**（`build/modules.conf.in`：`loggers/mod_syslog`），但 vanilla"
" **未加载**（`modules.conf.xml` "
"把它注释掉了）。若加载它，`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/syslog.conf.xml` 会以 facility "
"`user`、ident `freeswitch`、默认级别 `warning` 发送，并带 UUID。在 systemd 主机上，这通常经 "
"syslog 套接字出现在 journal 里。"

#: ../../11-observability.md:75 b0274d0c38c341a1b420e1b8562c8d3c
msgid ""
"`mod_graylog2` exists under `src/mod/loggers/mod_graylog2/` but is commented"
" in both `modules.conf.in` and vanilla `modules.conf.xml`."
msgstr ""
"`mod_graylog2` 位于 `src/mod/loggers/mod_graylog2/`，但在 `modules.conf.in` 和 "
"vanilla `modules.conf.xml` 中都被注释。"

